MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4b3f2a8c8f344355b16a4d4296ae3f98, type: 3}
  m_Name: BrittleStar
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  vesselClass: 16
  entries:
  - Element: 1
    AbilityLabel: Ring Detonation
    AbilityDescription: 'LT. Eject the support ring and throw it forward (240 u/s on top of your own speed); it blows on
      touching any mass or a rival hull, or on its 1.1 s fuse, in a RING EXPLOSION: a flat disk in the
      ring''s plane, as thick as the ring and as wide as the cell''s nucleus, sweeping out from the
      ring over 0.7 s. It destroys every prism it passes, any domain (your own and your allies'' too),
      and strips petals from every rival hull it passes (petals only - nothing is moved). No cooldown,
      only a ring: with a stored crystal charge a new ring is built at once (two in rapid succession);
      without one you fly ringless and modeless until a crystal builds the next. Charge is threat -
      one dial: the disk''s thickness x1 -> x4 at level 10 (BrittleStarConfigSO.blastScale), and the
      rounds'' size x1 -> x1.8 with it (projectileScaleMultiplier), the Rolling Thunder persona''s two
      halves of one idea.'
    Input: 2
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel: 
    UpgradeDescription: 
  - Element: 2
    AbilityLabel: Creation Mode
    AbilityDescription: 'B. A trail behind EACH of the ring''s five corners instead of the single small block from the
      cockpit - five lines that turn with the ring''s firing rotation. The SLOWEST mode: cruise x0.5.
      Needs the ring. Mass is volume - one dial: the corner trails'' blocks x1 -> x1.8 at level 10
      (BrittleStarConfigSO.creationBlockScale).'
    Input: 7
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel: 
    UpgradeDescription: 
  - Element: 3
    AbilityLabel: Destruction Mode
    AbilityDescription: 'X. The FIVE ARMS: while the mode is on, every turret fires on its own - unspread, at the
      Sparrow''s full-auto cadence (90 rounds/s each, 1350 u/s) - a stream steady enough to read as
      five arms reaching ahead of the ring. The right stick''s direction turns the ring, and the arms
      with it; its deflection moves them in and out: centred they meet 120 u ahead (the vessel a
      crosshair), pushed to the rim they splay 25 degrees. Outside it, Fire on RT (held) is one stream
      from the turret the right stick points at (the ring turns to bring it round) or the cockpit gun
      with the stick centred, the stick''s deflection opening the spread. Friendly fire is on. A round
      on a rival hull is a scored bullet hit (petals only). Space is reach - one dial: the rounds''
      flight time, and so their range, x1 -> x1.6 at level 10 (BrittleStarConfigSO.rangeMultiplier).'
    Input: 8
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel: 
    UpgradeDescription: 
  - Element: 4
    AbilityLabel: Speed Mode
    AbilityDescription: 'A. Ignite every thruster: the hull''s cruise speed x6, and the base trail''s spacing stretched
      by the same ratio so production per second does not rise. Needs the ring. A crystal collected
      with a charge already stored is OVERDRIVE - all three modes at once for 6 s. Time is rate - one
      dial: Speed Mode''s multiplier x6 -> x8 at level 10 (BrittleStarConfigSO.speedModeMultiplier).'
    Input: 6
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel: 
    UpgradeDescription: 
